# chad2 -- Chad's second intermezzo, at the start of Part Two.
# Copyright 2026 Corwin Brust; CC-BY-SA-4.0
#
# Chad is Corwin's own character, brief, confident, a little out of place,
# and he explains nothing. Part Two is how a ghostwheel wakes up, and Chad's
# one new short thing is to tell everyone not to get up. He repeats his line.
# (For the writers only, not the page: Part Two follows the run-levels per
# PLAN.md section 9, fork F1, lean (c); that is the plan's lean, not his
# ruling. Chad's line points at C4's backward consing, C4.md section 9,
# 2026-08-25; it is meant to land at chad3, near C4QL, and nowhere sooner.)
kind: intermezzo
title: Chad
part: Part Two: how a ghostwheel wakes up

== picture page ==
Oh! Chad is back.

"Hi. Don't get up. I got this."

"Last word first. Every time."

Spoke looks at Pin.

And then he was gone.

