== narration ==
[picture A]
narrator: Part Two. How a ghostwheel wakes up.
narrator: Shh. It's very early. The shop is still asleep.
narrator: Oh! Chad is back.
chad: Hi. Don't get up. I got this.
spoke: Don't get up? Everyone's just about to.
chad: Last word first. Every time.
pin: I'm writing that down again for you. Chad, at dawn, before the first floor.
narrator: And then he was gone.

[picture B]
narrator: Part Two. How a ghostwheel wakes up.
narrator: Oh! Chad is back.
chad: Hi. Don't get up. I got this.
spoke: Pin. He said don't get up.
pin: I heard.
chad: Last word first. Every time.
spoke: That again.
pin: Writing it down. Again.
narrator: And then he was gone.

